{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2012889/block/singleImage/3266075/df/01M787QG8S7ZE2V3E6T8BEFZ1D.jpg?updatedAt=1794499421\"/><p>韓流天團BIGBANG出道20周年，巡迴舉行的 「BIGBANG 2026-2027 WORLD TOUR &lt; XX : COSMOS &gt;」20周年紀念空間壓軸終站近日登陸山頂廣場，由即日起至11月22日免費開放予公眾參觀。活動以「COSMOS(宇宙)」為主題，透過多個展區展示歷年專輯、經典舞台元素及組合發展歷程，帶領粉絲重溫BIGBANG二十年來的重要時刻。</p><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2012889/block/singleImage/3266077/df/01M787QGA9D0Z5FRQCHDYDA1GD.jpg?updatedAt=1794499421\"/><p>活動焦點包括設於戶外空中花園的3米高巨型黃色皇冠花朵裝置。皇冠多年來一直是BIGBANG最具代表性的標誌之一，入夜後更會亮起燈光，成為期間限定打卡熱點。此外，展覽亦設有多個主題裝置及互動體驗區，讓粉絲沉浸於BIGBANG的音樂世界。免費登記成為hello恒隆商場獎賞計劃會員，並完成指定任務，可換領限定版BIGBANG紀念明信片及$50電子優惠券。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T21:44:50.284390+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":356,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:29:48.774535+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T21:37:47.101734+00:00","content_hash":"5558a7fcf9cf4ac5ca5c1db20943c5a4923c24af8082c505c9e9272397ab8e00","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T21:44:50.284390+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}